Akirsuäl	A former frontier province of Kûniüri, famed for the hill Swaranûl.
Akksersia	A lost Norsirai nation of the Ancient North, founded by Salaweärn I and centered on Myclai.
Aörsi	A lost Norsirai nation of the Ancient North, with Shiarau as its capital and Dagliash among its great fortresses.
Atrithau	An ancient administrative and commercial capital of Eämnor, built on anarcane ground at the foot of Mount Ankulakai.
Ce Tydonn	A Norsirai nation of the Three Seas.
Cengemis	A Ketyai nation of the Three Seas.
Cepalor	A Norsirai nation of the Three Seas.
Cingulat	A Ketyai nation of the Three Seas.
Cironj	A Ketyai nation of the Three Seas.
Conriya	A Ketyai nation of the Three Seas.
Dagliash	An ancient Aörsic fortress overlooking the River Sursa and the Plains of Agongorea, built atop the ruins of Viri.
Eämnor	A lost White Norsirai nation of the Ancient North, associated with Atrithau and Sobel.
Galeoth	A Norsirai nation of the Three Seas.
Girgash	A Ketyai nation of the Three Seas.
High Ainon	A Ketyai nation of the Three Seas.
Jekhia	A Xiuhianni nation of the Three Seas.
Kelmeöl	The ancient capital of the Meöri Empire.
Kian	A Ketyai nation of the Three Seas.
Kûniüri	A lost nation of the Ancient North and the last of the ancient Aumris empires, centered on Trysë.
Meneanor	One of the three seas in south-central Eärwa.
Meöri Empire|Meörn Empire	A lost nation of the Ancient North that grew from the city of Kelmeöl.
Myclai	The ancient administrative and commercial capital of Akksersia.
Nansur Empire	A Ketyai nation of the Three Seas.
Nilnamesh	A Ketyai nation of the Three Seas.
Nron	A Ketyai nation of the Three Seas.
Nyranisas	One of the three seas in south-central Eärwa.
Oncis	One of the three seas in south-central Eärwa.
Sakarpus	A city of the Ancient North in the heart of the Istyuli Plains.
Sansor	A Ketyai nation of the Three Seas.
Sauglish	An ancient city of the River Aumris Valley, established as an intellectual center of the Ancient North and home to the Great Library of Sauglish.
Shiarau	The ancient capital of Aörsi.
Sobel	An abandoned province north of Atrithau.
The Three Seas	A term for the seas of Meneanor, Nyranisas, and Oncis, and for the primarily Ketyai civilization of south-central Eärwa.
Thunyerus	A Norsirai nation of the Three Seas.
Trysë	The ancient administrative capital of Kûniüri and one of the greatest cities of the Ancient North.
Zeüm|High Holy Zeüm	A large Satyothi nation in the far south and west of Eärwa, known for its relative isolation, Zeümi silks and steel, and Sword-Dancers.
